< // ── Recall (crates/maos-domain/src/log_recall.rs) ─────────────────────
< // The caller's Spirit pid is NOT a parameter anywhere in this interface:
< // `LogRecallFilter` has no pid field by design (log_recall.rs:13-38, pinned by
< // crates/maos-bin/tests/cross_team_consent_13_3.rs:290-308). The host binds the
